Landscape phone 844x390: joystick 132 at bottom 18 → top 240; duel-player at top 150 height 50 → fine. Hotbar 2x2 top ~390-86-116=188, buttons bottom 16; duel player left. Enemy bar top 80 center; hotbar right starts ~844-12-116=716, enemy width 400 centered → 222..622, no overlap. good.

Now `.spell-slot` pointer events. And `#interact-prompt` pointer events.

