```css
body.touch, body.touch #game{touch-action:none}
```
Careful: panels need scrolling! If body touch-action none, panel-body scroll may break. Apply touch-action none only to #scene and controls; panels should scroll. `#scene{touch-action:none}` and controls. Also `#game` overscroll-behavior:none. Keep panel scrolling default. Add:
```css
#scene{touch-action:none}
#touch-ui, #joystick, .touch-btn{touch-action:none}
```
HUD buttons are fine.

Wheel/touch camera doesn't scroll due body overflow hidden.

Panels on touch need larger close buttons? panel-close 32px is okay-ish. Increase to 40 via body.touch.

