Also maybe reduce `#vignette` shadow and `#fog-overlay` on touch:
```css
body.touch #vignette{box-shadow:inset 0 0 80px rgba(3,2,8,.75)}
```

Add at end of CSS.

Also responsive existing <=820 `#hotbar-wrap` transform scale; our body.touch rules must come after media queries to override. Append at very end.

